DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Ach ja,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ich wollte dir schon längst
das hier wiedergeben.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tut mir leid,
dass ich es so lange hatte.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sadece senden ödünç aldığım şeyi
geri vermek istedim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu kadar uzun süre bende kaldığı
için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}You know how you said you wanted
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Well, I have a present!
I found one, so I went ahead and
bought it for you.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}You're always doing things for me,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and I just wanted to say thanks,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Hani {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} istediğini söylemiştin ya,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Sana bir hediyem var!
Bir tane bulunca senin için satın
aldım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Benim için hep bir şeyler
yapıyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ben de bir teşekkür
edeyim dedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neulich lag da was hinter meinem
Haus rum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Gehört das zufällig dir,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Riecht meine Wohnung nicht
schön nach {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Das ist mein neues Raumspray!
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Hm, oder hätte ich lieber die Sorte
{{TAG:0005:0010:0100}} nehmen sollen?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Irgendwie zieht es in meiner
Wohnung...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Kannst du mir helfen,
das zu reparieren, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
Tamam,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} benim gitmem gereken yerler
var!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Beni buraya getirdiğin için sağ ol,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
